## MCP - Tenant - Resolve

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/tenant-resolve

**Description:** Resolves Discord user_id to tenant_id via API backend.

**InputSchema:**
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["action", "user_id"],
  "properties": {
    "action": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["resolve"],
      "description": "Action a effectuer"
    },
    "user_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Discord user ID"
    },
    "guild_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Discord guild ID (optionnel)"
    }
  }
}
```

**Returns:**
- `tenant_id`: Resolved tenant identifier
- `user_id`: Original Discord user ID
- `subscription_status`: Subscription status
- `_trace`: Traceability information

**RFC:** RFC-049 Entity Storage Architecture

